  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1PE 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muomumue, nuenu bakashi, nukokele babayenu; nunku bikala bakuabo kabai bitabusha dî dia Nzambi, nebahetebue mu bualu bua Nzambi kabai ne dî dia Nzambi, ku bienzedi bia bakashi babo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hatangilabo bienzedi bienu bilengele bidi ne ditshina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Didilengesha diabo kadikadi dia hamʼbidi dia kuluka kua nsuki, anyi dia kuela kua bilenge bia ngolo, anyi dia kuluata kua bivualu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi dikale dia muntu musokoma wa mu mutshima, mu bivualu bidi kabi binyanguka bia mutshima wa kalolo ne ditalala, bidi bia mushinga mukole ku mesu kua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muomumue kabidi, bakashi ba tshijila ba kale bakadi batekemena Nzambi, bakadi badilengesha, bakadi bakokela babayabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bu muakatumikila Sala Abalahama, mumubikile Mukelenge; unuakulua bana bandi katataka, binuenza bimpe, ne binuikala kanui nutshinyishibua ku buowa buonso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu balume muomumue, nuikale ne bakashi benu bu mudi lungenyi luimpe, bu mudibo banutambe mubidi butekete, bu mudibo bahianyi nʼenu ba ngasa wa muoyo; bua kutendelela kuenu kakuhumbishibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Di dia kundekelu ne, Nuikale buonso buenu ne mutshima umue, nusambangane, nunangangane bu bana babo ba mu Kilisto, nuikale ne mitshima ya luse ne mitshima mihuekela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanushintakashi bubi ku bubi anyi tshihendu ku tshihendu; kadi nushintakashangane nʼabo disanka; bua nuakabikidibua bua muanda eu, bua nuenu kuhiana disanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nganyi wanuenzela bibi, binuaya bena lukunukunu ba malu mimpe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi binuakenga bualu bua buakane, nudi ne disanka; kanutshinyi kutshinyisha kuabo, kanulubakashibu mitshima yenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi nujidile Kilisto mu mitshima yenu bu Mukelenge; nuikale badilongolola misangu yonso, bua kukudimuna dî kudi muntu yonso udi unukonka bua muanda wa ditekemena didi munda muenu; kadi nuenze nunka ne kalolo ne dishina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuikale ne muoyomukese muimpe, bua, mu bualu budibo banusonguela, bobo badi bahenda bienzedi bienu bimpe binudi nʼabi mu Kilisto bafuishibue bundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua budi butambe buimpe, bikaladi disua dia Nzambi, bua mena nukenge bu benji ba malu mimpe, ne kanukengi bu benji ba malu mabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Kilisto wakafua musangu umue bua malu mabi, muntu muakane wakafuila bantu babi, bua kulua nʼetu kudi Nzambi; wakashihibua mubidi wandi, kadi wakavuishibua muoyo mu nyuma wandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muakayeye mu nyuma wandi kabidi, ne wakambila nyuma ya ba mu nsubu wa lukanu wa lufu bualu bua Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu aba bakadi ne buhidia diambedi, hakadi lutulu lua Nzambi luindila mu matuku a Noa, hakadi kuatu bunene bilongolodibua, muakasungidibua bantu banya-banya, bantu muanda mukulu mene, mu mai: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mai â kabidi adi tshifuanyikishi tshia adi atusungila katataka, nkubatiza mene, kembua diuvua dia manyanu a mubidi, kadi bua dikeba dia muoyo-mukese muimpe kudi Nzambi, bua dibika dia Yesu Kilisto ku lufu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "udi ku tshianza tshia bukole tshia Nzambi, mumane kubuela mu diulu; banjelo ne makokeshi ne makole biakavuishibua ku nyima kuandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
